PARITY MAPPING  (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported, no raw hex)
  generic T + accessors          → concrete ComboboxOption (id=getOptionKey, label=getOptionLabel,
                                   chipLabel=getChipLabel ?? getOptionLabel)
  defaultFilter                  → ComboboxMultiProjector.filter (trim/lowercase/label.contains, empty passthrough)
  hide-selected + de-dup + cap   → ComboboxMultiProjector.project (selectedKeys removal, unique-key, prefix cap,
                                   hiddenCount); "{{count}} more" → ComboboxMultiAccessibility.moreHidden
  static array OR async loader   → ComboboxMultiSource.search (StaticComboboxMultiSource filters synchronously;
                                   InMemory/production push the async result); model debounces (asyncDebounceMs=200)
  chips flex-wrap                → ComboboxChipsFlowLayout (SwiftUI Layout) + capsule chips (accent token tint)
  role=combobox input            → TextField bound to queryBinding; placeholder precedence via effectivePrompt
  keyboard model                 → .onKeyPress(.downArrow/.upArrow/.home/.end/.escape/.delete/.tab) + .onSubmit →
                                   model.moveActive*/closeDropdown/handleBackspace/commitActive (wrap semantics)
  chevron toggle (rotate)        → chevron.down Button + rotationEffect(open ? 180 : 0); labels closeListAria/
                                   openListAria
  loading spinner / "Loading"    → ProgressView (field) + ComboboxMultiLoadingRow
  empty "No results"/"Max"       → ComboboxMultiEmptyRow(message: emptyMessage = atMax ? maxReached : noResults)
  useAnnouncer                   → ComboboxMultiAnnouncer (AccessibilityNotification.Announcement); result count +
                                   "Removed {{label}}"
  aria-label "Remove {{label}}"  → ComboboxMultiAccessibility.removeLabel on each chip's remove button
  i18n                           → every string via ComboboxMultiStrings (NSLocalizedString table "ComboboxMulti",
                                   web literal as the value: fallback); %d/%@ templates
  telemetry                      → view.opened surface="ComboboxMulti" emitted once on start (P1/S11)

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → options resolving with none cached → the "Loading" row (web async loader spinner).
  empty    → resolved with no selectable options → "No results" / "Maximum reached" (web empty <li>), never blank.
  error    → async load failed → a retryable error view (P4 leaf; the web swallows the failure into an empty menu).
  content  → the de-duplicated, selection-removed, capped option rows + the "{n} more — refine search" footer.
  stale    → freshness chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → freshness chip + banner over the last-loaded options; no auto-refresh.

